 952  	///
 953  	/// Verification Steps:
 954  	/// 1. Check deadline hasn't expired
 955  	/// 2. Validate calldata minimum length
 956  	/// 3. Verify target is whitelisted
 957  	/// 4. Verify PartyB registration or resolve the PartyA account owner (delegation is checked on final calldata)
 958  	/// 5. Verify EIP-712 signature
 959  	/// 6. Prevent replay attacks
 960  	/// 7. Update nonce if required
